  "definition": "Equine and Other Animals Used for Utility",
  "effectiveDate": "2014-03-01",
  "historyNote": "#6167 eff 1-18-96, EXPIRED: 1-18-04 New. #8127, INERIM, eff 7-27-04, EXPIRED: 1-23-05 New. #8532, eff 1-1-06; ss by #10532, eff 3-1-14",
